# Dispatch wake continue

**Invariant:** `wake(dispatch ∨ consult ∨ watcher) ∧ new_information ⇒ ¬end(relay)` · name one next activity · `already_commissioned ⇒ start(it)`. The wake prompt says inform briefly and skip follow-up talk; that prompt does not close the turn.

| Forbidden | Permitted |
|---|---|
| Relay the result and stop | Say what the information unblocks, name one next activity |
| Wait for "continue" when the next step was already commissioned | Start that step |
| A menu of next steps | One recommendation. Wait only for a human-only gate |

| Bad | Good |
|---|---|
| "The review is in. Item 3 is the wrong next change." | "Item 3 is the wrong next change. Next is one brochure source through v2, no file edits. Running it." |
